{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2022-10-11 04:00:00', 'title': 'POLAR CAPITAL APPOINTS NORTHERN TRUST TO PROVIDE ASSET SERVICING SOLUTIONS TO ITS MELCHIOR SELECTED TRUST', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORTHERN TRUST (NASDAQ: NTRS) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN APPOINTED BY POLAR CAPITAL TO PROVIDE GLOBAL CUSTODY, DEPOSITARY, TRANSFER AGENCY, FUND ACCOUNTING AND CURRENCY MANAGEMENT-RELATED SERVICES TO ITS MELCHIOR SELECTED TRUST. HEADQUARTERED IN LONDON, POLAR CAPITAL IS A SPECIALIST, INVESTMENT-LED, ACTIVE FUND MANAGER WITH £19 BILLION OF ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT (AS AT 30 JUNE 2022). IT CURRENTLY HAS 15 AUTONOMOUS INVESTMENT TEAMS IN THE UNITED KINGDOM, FRANCE, SPAIN,'}